{'symbol': 'JKHY', 'date': '2023-05-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'JACK HENRY CONTINUES PHASE OUT OF SCREEN SCRAPING ON THE BANNO DIGITAL BANKING PLATFORM', 'text': 'COMPANY HAS REPLACED INBOUND SCREEN SCRAPING WITH SAFE AND SECURE CONSUMER-PERMISSIONED DATA SHARING THROUGH OPEN-BANKING APIS ACROSS HUNDREDS OF THOUSANDS OF APPS AND MILLIONS OF ACCOUNTHOLDERS MONETT, MO. , MAY 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACK HENRY™ (NASDAQ: JKHY) ANNOUNCED IT CONTINUES TO REPLACE INBOUND SCREEN SCRAPING ON ITS BANNO DIGITAL BANKING PLATFORM WITH API CONNECTIONS TO ALL FIVE MAJOR DATA EXCHANGE PLATFORMS, FINICITY, AKOYA, PLAID, ENVESTNET | YODLEE , AND INTUIT, GIVING ACCOUNTHOLDERS MORE CONTROL OF THEIR FINANCIAL DATA AND PROTECTING FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS FROM A WIDE RANGE OF FRAUD AND SECURITY RISKS THAT ARISE FROM PASSWORDS SHARED WITH THIRD PARTIES.'}